      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. Can we add some documentation/comment how these allowlist and denylists work with GenruleSandboxing product var? Reading `DepfileAllowList` and `SandboxingDenyModuleList`, I feel like we just need one or the other. `SandboxingDenyModuleList` has the modules that we don\u0027t enable inputs sandbox while `DepfileAllowList` has the modules that we allow using `depfile` prop. Aren\u0027t they the same thing?\n\n2. Can we consolidate SandboxingDenyPathList into SandboxingDenyModuleList for the sake of simplicity?",
